  "description": "HuggingFace CDN proxy extension for SpawnDev.WebTorrent.Server. Fetches model files from HuggingFace's CDN on demand, caches locally, generates SHA-256 .torrent files, and serves as a BEP 17/19 web seed. Adds per-model request stats, LRU cache eviction, and configurable disk-headroom guards. Optional extension - SpawnDev.WebTorrent.Server works without it.",
